      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? my surgeon said i'd be sore for a week and that some fever is expected. it's not like i'm in agony or anything, just a dull ache that's getting more intense. and the hardness... i just thought it was inflammation from the incisions. i don't want to go to the ER if it's just gonna be a waste of time and money. can you just help me figure out if this is actually serious or if i can just take some more ibuprofen and wait it out?",
